  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">M&amp;E Toolkit: OCFT Sector-Specific Interventions and Cross-Cutting Themes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) Toolkit project will help enhance the sustainability of child labor and forced labor program efforts by contributing to the overall body of knowledge on how best to assess child labor and forced labor interventions. The project will undertake assessments and development practical tools, templates, and guidelines for monitoring cross-cutting sectors related to child labor and forced labor, including occupational safety and health of youth, youth employment, strengthened technical and institutional capacity on labor issues, gender and diversity, persons with disabilities, migration, and sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
